    "guideLoiPhrase": "Declare the distribution as on the board: X ∼ B(10 ; 0.3) (binomial), P(3) (Poisson), G(0.2) (geometric, first success). Then P(X=3)=, P(X≤3)=, P(2≤X<5)=, P(X>8)=, E(X)=, V(X)=, σ(X)=. The smallest integer k with P(X≤k)≥0.95: write P(X≤k)≥0.95. With the keyboard: X~B(10;0.3), P(X<=3)=, sigma(X)=.",
