    "guideAjustementTitre": "Curve fitting, regression",
    "guideAjustementPhrase": "ajustement([1;2;3;4];[2;4;5;8]) gives the least-squares line y = ax + b and the correlation coefficient r. Add a model: exp (y = a·e^(bx)), ln (y = a·ln x + b), puissance (y = a·x^b), 2 (y = ax² + bx + c). Values separated by ;. With the keyboard.",
