    "guideSelectionTitre": "Select, move, duplicate a line",
    "guideSelectionPhrase": "In Tools, Select a line, then tap or circle it (or long-press its result): it gets a frame. Drag it or use the arrows; Duplicate copies it below, Delete erases it (Undo brings it back), Copy LaTeX puts it on the clipboard.",
    "guideSelectionMots": "select selection move drag duplicate copy paste delete latex clipboard long press circle lasso",
