    "guideJugerTitre": "A line's button",
    "guideJugerPhrase": "Each read line has a single small drawn button (an arrow and three dots), placed without covering the writing. It opens a list: right (the reading is good), wrong (opens its correction), correct, the other possible readings, plot or place, then what can be done with the line. A line marked right shows a small tick. These judged lines help reading on the device.",
