    "guideSignesTitre": "Correct a sign",
    "guideSignesPhrase": "In Correct, touch a sign of the read line: its other readings appear, and your choice is remembered on the device.",
    "guideSignesMots": "sign correct reading other letter digit",
    "guideAutresLecturesTitre": "Or maybe…",
    "guideAutresLecturesPhrase": "When a line can be read several ways, its button's list and Correct offer the other readings: choose the right one.",
    "guideAutresLecturesMots": "other reading choose maybe doubt",
    "guideAuPropreTitre": "Write neatly",
    "guideAuProprePhrase": "Settings › Write neatly: what is read is written neatly in place of your ink; your handwriting is kept.",
